  "triggers": [
    {
      "id": "comms_room_welcome",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "text": "A small room cluttered with radio equipment. Most of the panels are dark. Static hisses from a damaged speaker."
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "nightside_map_hint",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "not": {
            "hasFlag": "visited_dead_road"
          }
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "A hand-drawn survey map is tacked to the wall near the entrance — outpost patrol routes marked in fading ink.",
            "One route has been crossed out in red pencil. Alongside it, in cramped handwriting: 'Dead Road. Beyond: Nightside. DO NOT PROCEED WITHOUT AUTHORIZATION.'",
            "The authorization stamp is blank."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "daley_quest_start",
      "event": "npc_interacted",
      "filter": {
        "npcType": "comms_officer_daley"
      },
      "conditions": [
        {
          "not": {
            "hasFlag": "daley_quest_active"
          }
        },
        {
          "not": {
            "hasFlag": "comms_restored"
          }
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "setFlag",
          "flag": "daley_quest_active"
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "daley_comms_restored",
      "event": "npc_interacted",
      "filter": {
        "npcType": "comms_officer_daley"
      },
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasItem": "circuit_board"
        },
        {
          "hasItem": "backup_power_cell"
        },
        {
          "not": {
            "hasFlag": "comms_restored"
          }
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "removeItem",
          "itemType": "circuit_board"
        },
        {
          "type": "removeItem",
          "itemType": "backup_power_cell"
        },
        {
          "type": "setFlag",
          "flag": "comms_restored"
        },
        {
          "type": "giveItem",
          "itemType": "signal_booster_chip"
        },
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "text": "Comms partially restored! You received a Signal Booster chip."
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "daley_gives_coordinates",
      "event": "npc_interacted",
      "filter": {
        "npcType": "comms_officer_daley"
      },
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasFlag": "comms_restored"
        },
        {
          "hasFlag": "arrived_meridian"
        },
        {
          "not": {
            "hasFlag": "daley_gave_coordinates"
          }
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "setFlag",
          "flag": "daley_gave_coordinates"
        },
        {
          "type": "giveItem",
          "itemType": "daley_coordinates"
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore_array_transmission_pickup",
      "event": "item_picked_up",
      "filter": {
        "itemType": "lore_array_transmission"
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "A printed log of early Array communications, dated years before this outpost was built.",
            "One entry is circled in red ink: 'REQUEST: Subsurface mineral survey data, Nightside quadrant 7-North. PRIORITY: Maximum. REASON: [FIELD EXCEEDS PROTOCOL LENGTH].'",
            "Someone has written in the margin: 'They never did explain why.'",
            "Wren Alcott monitors Array communications. She'd find this very interesting."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "wren_nightside_hint",
      "event": "npc_interacted",
      "filter": {
        "npcType": "wren_alcott"
      },
      "conditions": [
        {
          "not": {
            "hasFlag": "wren_nightside_hint_shown"
          }
        },
        {
          "not": {
            "hasFlag": "visited_dead_road"
          }
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "setFlag",
          "flag": "wren_nightside_hint_shown"
        },
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "Wren taps the circled entry in the array transmission log. 'Nightside quadrant 7-North. Maximum priority, reason redacted — that's not normal Array protocol.'",
            "'I've been trying to triangulate the source. Whatever they were after is out past the Dead Road, beyond the outer perimeter gate. North into the black.'",
            "'If you're heading out that way, bring everything you've got. The cold out there isn't natural.'"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "daley_signal_complete",
      "event": "npc_interacted",
      "filter": {
        "npcType": "comms_officer_daley"
      },
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasItem": "lightkeeper_journal"
        },
        {
          "hasFlag": "signal_source_found"
        },
        {
          "not": {
            "hasFlag": "broken_signal_complete"
          }
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "removeItem",
          "itemType": "lightkeeper_journal"
        },
        {
          "type": "setFlag",
          "flag": "broken_signal_complete"
        },
        {
          "type": "grantXp",
          "amount": 50
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "endgame_comms_shutdown",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasFlag": "endgame_active"
        },
        {
          "hasFlag": "chose_path_shutdown"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "The comms room is quieter now — and louder. The Array relay panels are dark, their constant background hum finally silenced.",
            "In their place, Daley has rigged a patchwork of independent radio equipment. Analog dials, manual tuning, hand-soldered connections. The open frequencies crackle with human voices from outposts across the terminator.",
            "And beneath it all, if you listen carefully, something else. A low, resonant hum from the walls themselves — the Underlumen, no longer masked by Array traffic."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "setTile",
          "x": 5,
          "y": 4,
          "tileId": 2
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "endgame_comms_merge",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasFlag": "endgame_active"
        },
        {
          "hasFlag": "chose_path_merge"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "The comms room is transformed. Daley's equipment shares space with something organic — a bioluminescent growth that pulses in rhythm with incoming transmissions.",
            "Three signal layers displayed on a makeshift monitor: Array data, human radio, and Underlumen bio-frequencies. They weave together like voices in harmony.",
            "The damaged speaker that once hissed static now carries a sound like breathing. The planet, the machine, and the people — all talking at once."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "endgame_comms_control",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasFlag": "endgame_active"
        },
        {
          "hasFlag": "chose_path_control"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "The comms room has been upgraded. Ring Authority standard-issue equipment replaces Daley's improvised repairs — clean lines, military encryption, full-spectrum monitoring.",
            "Every relay frequency the Array once controlled is now routed through Ring Authority protocols. Suppression field telemetry scrolls across a new display panel.",
            "The room hums with power and efficiency. Only the deep-earth frequencies are absent — suppressed along with whatever was producing them."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    }
  ]
}
